<title>JAPAN: Copyer - 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Copyer - 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 91.47		vs	   95.14</p>
<p> Operating	    1.09		vs	    1.59</p>
<p> Current	    793    million    vs	  483    million</p>
<p> Net		  799    million    vs	  115    million</p>
<p> EPS		   19.73 yen	  vs	    2.84 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 19.05 yen	  vs	     nil yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Copyer Co Ltd is a medium-scale maker of photocopying machines.</p>
